* #donor-center "Donor Center" "A center that recruits and manages donors."
* #transplant-center "Transplant Center" "A center that performs transplants."
* #collection-center "Collection Center" "A center that collects stem cells or marrow."
* #apheresis-center "Apheresis Center" "A center that performs apheresis procedures."
* #cord-blood-bank "Cord Blood Bank" "A facility that stores cord blood units."
